  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan - Africa Complex Emergency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In April 2023, Sudan plunged into a dire humanitarian crisis as a result of an armed conflict. As a long-term partner to Sudanese Red Crescent Society (SRCS), NLRC is committed to support its local partner in responding to the nation-wide crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project, Netherlands Red Cross supports the Sudanese Red Crescent Society (SRCS) through a contribution to the IFRC Emergency Appeal (IFRC Secretariat) in addition to PRJ13-149-0010 - a bilateral project in support of the overall objectives in this Emergency Appeal.</narrative>
  </description>
